{"id":"5-meo-dmt","name":"5-MeO-DMT","form":"spray","status":"Well-documented","aliases":"5meodmt, toads, 5-meo, 5meo, 5-medmt","category":"Psychedelic","chemicalClass":"Substituted tryptamines","psychoactiveClass":"Psychedelic","addictionPotential":"non-addictive with a low abuse potential","toxicity":["toxic dose is unknown"],"summarySources":"PsychonautWiki, TripSit","summary":"A powerful psychedelic tryptamine found in many species of plants and some toad venom. There is a reported history of use by native South Americans spanning thousands of years. The drug has similar qualities to DMT and related tryptamines. The drug is reported to be very potent and orally active in combination with an MAOI.","doseMaxTick":40,"doseUnit":"mg","doseRows":[{"roa":"Insufflated","source":"PsychonautWiki","unit":"mg","threshold":"3 mg","light":"5–8 mg","common":"8–15 mg","strong":"15–25 mg","heavy":"25 mg+","commonEstimate":12,"band":{"low":8,"high":15},"domain":[2.4,33.75],"segments":{"light":[5,8],"common":[8,15],"strong":[15,25],"heavy":[25,32.4]}},{"roa":"Smoked","source":"PsychonautWiki","unit":"mg","threshold":"1 mg","light":"3–6 mg","common":"6–12 mg","strong":"12–20 mg","heavy":"20 mg+","commonEstimate":9,"band":{"low":6,"high":12},"domain":[0.8,27],"segments":{"light":[3,6],"common":[6,12],"strong":[12,20],"heavy":[20,25.92]}}],"durationSources":"PsychonautWiki, TripSit","durationRows":[{"roa":"Insufflated","onset":"1–10 min","comeup":"—","peak":"10–40 min","offset":"30–60 min","afterEffects":"1–3 h","total":"2–3 h"},{"roa":"Smoked","onset":"5–60 s","comeup":"30–60 s","peak":"5–15 min","offset":"10–20 min","afterEffects":"15–60 min","total":"20–40 min"}],"tolerance":{"buildUp":"almost immediately after ingestion","reset":"2 hours","milestones":[{"label":"Full tolerance","value":"almost immediately after ingestion","tone":"danger"},{"label":"Half tolerance","value":"1 hour","tone":"warning"},{"label":"Baseline","value":"2 hours","tone":"positive"}],"crossTolerances":[]},"subjectiveEffects":[{"name":"Amnesia","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Amnesia"},{"name":"Analysis enhancement","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Analysis_enhancement"},{"name":"Anxiety","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Anxiety"},{"name":"Auditory distortion","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Auditory_distortion"},{"name":"Auditory enhancement","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Auditory_enhancement"},{"name":"Auditory hallucinations","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Auditory_hallucinations"},{"name":"Bodily control enhancement","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Bodily_control_enhancement"},{"name":"Bodily pressures","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Bodily_pressures"},{"name":"Changes in gravity","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Changes_in_gravity"},{"name":"Colour enhancement","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Colour_enhancement"},{"name":"Colour shifting","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Colour_shifting"},{"name":"Conceptual thinking","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Conceptual_thinking"},{"name":"Delusions","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Delusions"},{"name":"Drifting","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Drifting"},{"name":"Emotion enhancement","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Emotion_enhancement"},{"name":"Environmental orbism","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Environmental_orbism"},{"name":"Geometry","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Geometry"},{"name":"Memory suppression","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Memory_suppression"},{"name":"Mindfulness","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Mindfulness"},{"name":"Motor control loss","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Motor_control_loss"},{"name":"Nausea","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Nausea"},{"name":"Perception of increased weight","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Perception_of_increased_weight"},{"name":"Physical euphoria","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Physical_euphoria"},{"name":"Pupil dilation","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Pupil_dilation"},{"name":"Recursion","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Recursion"},{"name":"Skin flushing","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Skin_flushing"},{"name":"Subconscious communication","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Subconscious_communication"},{"name":"Tactile enhancement","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Tactile_enhancement"},{"name":"Temperature regulation suppression","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Temperature_regulation_suppression"},{"name":"Thought connectivity","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Thought_connectivity"},{"name":"Time distortion","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Time_distortion"},{"name":"Unity and interconnectedness","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Unity_and_interconnectedness"},{"name":"Wakefulness","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Wakefulness"},{"name":"Smoked: short duration"},{"name":"Powerful rushing of sensation"},{"name":"Overwhelming fear"},{"name":"Panic"},{"name":"Experience of \"the void\""},{"name":"Ego death"}],"combinations":[{"substance":"Amphetamines","status":"Unsafe","tone":"danger","note":"Documented unsafe interaction on PsychonautWiki."},{"substance":"AMT","status":"Dangerous","tone":"danger","note":"Documented dangerous interaction on PsychonautWiki."},{"substance":"Cocaine","status":"Unsafe","tone":"danger","note":"Documented unsafe interaction on PsychonautWiki."},{"substance":"Dxm","status":"Unsafe","tone":"danger","note":"Documented unsafe interaction on PsychonautWiki."},{"substance":"MAOIs","status":"Dangerous","tone":"danger","note":"Documented dangerous interaction on PsychonautWiki."},{"substance":"PCP","status":"Dangerous","tone":"danger","note":"Documented dangerous interaction on PsychonautWiki."},{"substance":"Tramadol","status":"Unsafe","tone":"danger","note":"Documented unsafe interaction on PsychonautWiki."},{"substance":"2C-T-x","status":"Caution","tone":"warning","note":"Uncertain or unpredictable interaction on PsychonautWiki."},{"substance":"2C-x","status":"Caution","tone":"warning","note":"Uncertain or unpredictable interaction on PsychonautWiki."},{"substance":"Cannabis","status":"Caution","tone":"warning","note":"Uncertain or unpredictable interaction on PsychonautWiki."},{"substance":"DOx","status":"Caution","tone":"warning","note":"Uncertain or unpredictable interaction on PsychonautWiki."},{"substance":"MDMA","status":"Caution","tone":"warning","note":"Uncertain or unpredictable interaction on PsychonautWiki."},{"substance":"Mescaline","status":"Caution","tone":"warning","note":"Uncertain or unpredictable interaction on PsychonautWiki."},{"substance":"Nbome","status":"Caution","tone":"warning","note":"Uncertain or unpredictable interaction on PsychonautWiki."}],"citations":[],"helpfulLinks":[{"title":"PsychonautWiki","description":"Pharmacology, subjective effects, and dosage reference","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/5-MeO-DMT"},{"title":"TripSit Factsheet","description":"Rapid harm-reduction summary and combination data","url":"https://drugs.tripsit.me/5-meo-dmt"},{"title":"Erowid Experience Vaults","description":"First-person experience reports and archives","url":"https://www.erowid.org/experiences/subs/exp_5MeODMT.shtml"},{"title":"TiHKAL Entry","description":"Alexander & Ann Shulgin tryptamine monograph","url":"https://www.erowid.org/library/books_online/tihkal/tihkal38.shtml"},{"title":"Wikipedia","description":"Encyclopedia article","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/5-MeO-DMT"},{"title":"Wikidata","description":"Structured data on 5-MeO-DMT","url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q570757"},{"title":"維基百科","description":"zh:Encyclopedia article","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/zh-tw/5-%E7%94%B2%E6%B0%A7%E5%9F%BA%E4%BA%8C%E7%94%B2%E5%9F%BA%E8%89%B2%E8%83%BA"}],"wikidata":"Q570757","warnings":[{"text":"Never with an MAOI, including Syrian rue, harmala or ayahuasca. A 19-year-old died of multiple organ failure in January 2023 after taking 24 ephedrine asthma tablets, then drinking a home brew of Syrian rue (harmala) and acacia bark boiled for over an hour and a half. Acacia bark can hold 5-MeO-DMT without you knowing, so an acacia brew with harmala is this dangerous mix.","source":"From FreeODwiki report RP-74.","url":"https://freeodwiki.org/%E6%96%87%E6%A1%A3/%E8%A1%A5%E6%A1%A3/Overdosewiki/Report/RP-74.html","report":"rp-74"}],"formula":"C13H18N2O","molarMass":218.29,"pharmacology":{"text":"5-MeO-DMT is a methoxylated derivative of dimethyltryptamine (DMT). While most common psychedelics are believed to primarily elicit psychological effects through agonism of serotonin 5-HT2A receptors, 5-MeO-DMT shows 1,000-fold greater affinity for the serotonin 5-HT1A receptor over the serotonin 5-HT2A receptor.","source":"Wikipedia","page":"5-MeO-DMT","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/5-MeO-DMT#Pharmacodynamics","kind":"Non-selective serotonin receptor agonist; Serotonin 5-HT1A receptor agonist; Serotonin 5-HT2A receptor agonist; Serotonergic psychedelic; Hallucinogen","body":[{"what":"halfLife","says":"Intranasal: 15–26 min; Sublingual: 28 min"},{"what":"brokenDown","says":"Oxidative deamination (MAO), O-demethylation (CYP2D6)"},{"what":"turnsInto","says":"Bufotenin"}],"figures":"5-MeO-DMT"},"uses":{"text":"5-MeO-DMT is used as a recreational drug and as an entheogen. It is not orally active, requiring a parenteral route such as smoking to produce effects. Other non-oral routes such as intravenous injection, intramuscular injection, rectal administration, sublingual administration, or intranasal administration have also less commonly been used.","source":"Wikipedia","page":"5-MeO-DMT","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/5-MeO-DMT#Use_and_effects","routes":"Inhalation, insufflation, sublingual, rectal, intramuscular, intravenous, oral (with an MAOI like harmaline)","figures":"5-MeO-DMT"},"sideEffects":{"text":"Adverse effects of 5-MeO-DMT include sickness, vomiting, headache, chest pressure, fatigue, anxiety, fear, terror, confusion, paranoia, crying, loss of awareness and motor control, and reactivations.","source":"Wikipedia","page":"5-MeO-DMT","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/5-MeO-DMT"},"summaryZh":"5-甲氧基二甲基色胺是一種二甲基色胺衍生物，屬於一種色胺類致幻劑，存在於很多植物和蟾蜍中，1936年由東京工業大學的星野敏雄首次合成。","ai":{"by":"Claude (Anthropic)","date":"2026-11-27","fact":{"en":"It occurs in the venom of the Colorado River toad, Incilius alvarius, and in many plants. The toad stores it in glands behind its eyes, and demand for the venom has raised conservation worries about the animal.","zh":"它存在於科羅拉多河蟾蜍（Incilius alvarius）的毒液與許多植物中。這種蟾蜍把它儲存在眼後的腺體裡，而對毒液的需求已引發對這種動物保育的擔憂。","zhHans":"它存在于科罗拉多河蟾蜍（Incilius alvarius）的毒液与许多植物中。这种蟾蜍把它保存在眼后的腺体里，而对毒液的需求已引发对这种动物保育的担忧。"}}}